# Invariant 5's exception: with no member device online, an external commit is accepted even though
# an instance proposal is outstanding. The proposal it omitted is re-issued for the new epoch, the
# freeze stays, and mls.commit_needed goes to the joiner - the one online device - who commits it.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
group chat kind=text target=d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5d5 community=none creator=alice
join bob chat via=welcome
sync bob
kick alice bob
go_offline alice
go_offline bob
external_join carol chat
expect_frame mls.commit_needed
commit carol
send carol chat hello from the joiner
go_online alice
expect_decrypts alice chat hello from the joiner
